# Scene 7: a failure you can read, and so can an agent. The labels of a real report (docs/_snippets, written by
# BugGalleryTests), the seed that replays it, the typed result tools get, and the close.
Import //reels/entities.reelpreset
Screen code

Output //.artifacts/reel/scenes/07-reports.mp4
Set Viewport 1600x900
Set FontSize 22

Code //docs/_snippets/conservation.txt
Say "Every failure reads the same way. Written for you, and for the agent fixing it with you."
Say@over "The rule, by name, [rule] and what it saw."
Wait [rule]
Mark "money-is-conserved" 1
Say@over "The operation, [op] the smallest state it started from, and what it produced."
Wait [op]
Mark "MoveWithFee(2)" 2
Mark "Total = 16" 3
Mark "Total = 15" 4
Say@over "The law it broke, [law] and why that matters."
Wait [law]
Mark "No operation creates or destroys" 5
Mark "Totals drift" 6
Say@over "And a seed. [seed] Paste it in, and the same case runs again, while you fix it."
Wait [seed]
Mark ".Seed(" 7
Callout "after 2 shrinks" "shrunk from whatever CsCheck found first"
Sleep 1500ms
Callout off
Mark off

Code@slide-left //src/Nullean.Entities.CsCheck/AxisResult.cs at "public abstract record AxisResult"
Focus lines 10-32
Say "For tools, each axis is a typed result: passed, with the rules it reached, or failed, with the report and its seed."
Mark "Passed(Axis Axis, IReadOnlyList<string> Rules, int Samples" 1
Mark "Failed(Axis Axis, string Report, string? Seed" 2
Say@skeptic "So an agent reads it, replays it, and fixes it."
Mark off
Focus off

Code@crossfade //reels/code/Install.cs
Say "The core has no dependencies and runs under native AOT. And a new rule can start as a warning."
Say "Model your world. Get the tests for free."
Sleep 800ms
